* {{rhymes|en|ɛɹəs|s=2}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of or containing [[iron]].
# {{lb|en|chemistry}} Of [[compound]]s of iron in which it has a [[valence]] or [[oxidation number]] of 2.
# Of an [[element]]: iron, or in certain ways similar to iron: ferrous metals.

